1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,252
I run a small team

2
00:00:02,302 --> 00:00:04,894
and we don’t have a project manager.

3
00:00:05,144 --> 00:00:06,626
Every call ended with

4
00:00:06,676 --> 00:00:08,157
‘so who’s doing what?’

5
00:00:08,407 --> 00:00:09,889
and then nothing happened.

6
00:00:10,139 --> 00:00:11,620
So we built Octo.

7
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:13,352
It joins the call,

8
00:00:13,402 --> 00:00:15,994
you can ask it things out loud,

9
00:00:16,044 --> 00:00:17,526
and after the call

10
00:00:17,576 --> 00:00:19,428
everyone gets their own tasks

11
00:00:19,478 --> 00:00:21,700
with the exact words they said.

12
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:24,172
It’s on our calls every day.

13
00:00:24,422 --> 00:00:26,644
Early access is open, link below.
